{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to try the Deep Space Corridor Demo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a classic horror game focused on finding anomalies, with some additional storyline elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Demo version, <u>only the <strong>first loop</strong> of the game is available for players to experience!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game consists of 3 loops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each loop requires players to make correct judgments a certain number of times in a row.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As the loop depth increases, players will face more dangerous enemies and more bizarre scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version of the game, each correctly judged level will unlock an achievement, but <strong><u>the Demo version does not offer the achievement unlocking function!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as a so-called &quot;investigator&quot; who wakes up on a mysterious space station, tasked with inspecting a designated area to determine if any abnormal phenomena exist within it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/fcfdf9d4c28e81671108b98cdf4eac35.avif?t=1754366845\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you detect anomalies, exit through the red door at the end of the corridor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you deem the area normal, exit through the blue door at the end of the corridor.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may encounter strange sights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also come across deadly enemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you might run into cute rabbits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you make correct judgments repeatedly, the story behind the mysterious space station will gradually unfold. After making a certain number of consecutive judgments, you'll advance to the next depth of the game, uncovering more truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/248e0d6fc84bfd8252703315df4d231e.avif?t=1754366845\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you've fully cleared the story, a full collection mode will become available, allowing you to revisit and collect all abnormal events. Each correct judgment of an anomaly will unlock a unique achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep Space Corridor</i> offers a short but slightly terrifying \u730e\u5947 (bizarre) experience (approximately 60 minutes).<br>The game draws inspiration from \u300a<i>P.T.\u300b</i>, \u300a<i>The Exit 8\u300b</i>, and \u300a<i>The Cabin Factory\u300b</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906210?t=1754366845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/1750f0e23bdfa3fe4e1069deaa1b30efe4b860dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754366845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/bebbc3703fdaf7fa7b369e3e385489c07d5d10fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754366845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/bebbc3703fdaf7fa7b369e3e385489c07d5d10fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754366845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to try the Deep Space Corridor Demo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a classic horror game focused on finding anomalies, with some additional storyline elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the Demo version, <u>only the <strong>first loop</strong> of the game is available for players to experience!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game consists of 3 loops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each loop requires players to make correct judgments a certain number of times in a row.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As the loop depth increases, players will face more dangerous enemies and more bizarre scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version of the game, each correctly judged level will unlock an achievement, but <strong><u>the Demo version does not offer the achievement unlocking function!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as a so-called &quot;investigator&quot; who wakes up on a mysterious space station, tasked with inspecting a designated area to determine if any abnormal phenomena exist within it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/fcfdf9d4c28e81671108b98cdf4eac35.avif?t=1754366845\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you detect anomalies, exit through the red door at the end of the corridor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you deem the area normal, exit through the blue door at the end of the corridor.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may encounter strange sights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/418e94369da3a7ee8628557b7ab8b9d3.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may also come across deadly enemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/51bbb94c79752032fcb99bd36504ab0f.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you might run into cute rabbits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.poster.avif?t=1754366845\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.webm?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/8b275b99d2789c2c9bf6306baa70d26a.mp4?t=1754366845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you make correct judgments repeatedly, the story behind the mysterious space station will gradually unfold. After making a certain number of consecutive judgments, you'll advance to the next depth of the game, uncovering more truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/extras/248e0d6fc84bfd8252703315df4d231e.avif?t=1754366845\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once you've fully cleared the story, a full collection mode will become available, allowing you to revisit and collect all abnormal events. Each correct judgment of an anomaly will unlock a unique achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Deep Space Corridor</i> offers a short but slightly terrifying \u730e\u5947 (bizarre) experience (approximately 60 minutes).<br>The game draws inspiration from \u300a<i>P.T.\u300b</i>, \u300a<i>The Exit 8\u300b</i>, and \u300a<i>The Cabin Factory\u300b</i>.</p>","developers":["Night Watcher Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3794750","name":"Deep Space Corridor"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906210/9294a51af45d7252016e2eec41fc92f3c9cb6d8b/header.jpg?t=1754366845","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173532,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173532/movie480.mp4?t=1754366843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173532/movie_max.mp4?t=1754366843"},"name":"SH","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173532/7169973afb128ded09dc350fb955adf7b78f3e2c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754366843","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173532/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754366843","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173532/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754366843"}}],"name":"Deep Space Corridor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><st